WEBVTT

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:24.910
Nervous?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.120
Don't worry.

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:29.660
All our customers are nice.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.620
A lot of them are perverts, though.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:32.790
Masochists, too.

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:34.620
Occasionally, you'll get one that freaks you out.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:36.160
Cut it out.

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:40.910
New girl, you've got a client.

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:44.200
See you later.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.500
Good luck!

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:52.660
Relax. It's Room 304, down below.

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:02.120
So you're Tilarna?

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:05.620
Yes, I am Tilarna Elnebara.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:07.200
Do you speak Earth language?

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.500
A little.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.580
Come here.

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:16.000
Your socks...

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Leave your socks on.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.620
I prefer it that way.

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:24.080
You're new, I heard?

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:25.200
Yes.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:28.000
Don't worry.
There's nothing to be nervous about.

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:31.040
What?

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:34.950
Christ.

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:41.290
This is the police. You're under arrest!

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.700
Wait! This is some kind of mistake.

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:45.910
I just...

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:50.450
You just happened to find yourself
in the room of a high-priced brothel?

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:52.250
Yeah, right.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:55.250
You sure as hell don't look like the pizza guy.

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:57.410
You must've gotten the wrong room!

00:01:57.410 --> 00:01:59.160
Listen to me.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:00.870
Sure, we'll listen to you.

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:03.950
Once we get down to the station,
you can talk all you like.

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:07.160
It's closing time.
Get ready to go home, miss.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:10.200
I didn't lay a finger on her! It's true!

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:11.160
Take him in, boys.

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:12.750
--This way!
--Hey, get off me!

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:14.080
Now then...

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:16.790
Oww! What do you want?

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:20.410
You're late! He touched my hair!

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:22.500
--Idiot! Dummy! Rakebye!
--Knock it off!

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.620
We got the info on the club, so who cares?

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:29.410
I care! If you were five seconds later,
I would've killed him!

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:31.750
Don't let the judge hear that, okay?

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:35.290
Hey, his stuff's still here.

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:36.700
Let me see...

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:39.080
Cole Mozeleemay.

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:42.160
I'm pretty sure I've seen him somewhere...

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:43.870
You finally noticed?

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:48.540
Mayoral candidate... A politician?

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:51.000
You sometimes see him on the news.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.660
Well, what do you know?

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:30.790
Mr. Mozeleemay, is it true that
you were using a dating club?

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.540
Some of the staff there
were reported to be minors...

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.000
Will you be dropping out of the mayoral race?

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:42.040
I'll be putting the date of my official
press conference on my blog shortly.

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:45.450
I've spent years dealing with issues
involving Semanians and poverty.

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:47.540
And I'm sure that many
of you are confused by

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:49.660
the baseless allegations that
have been levied against me.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:53.250
But I'll do everything I can
to stand up to this abuse of power.

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:54.370
That is all!

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:04.700
Marla, I...

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.700
It's okay, honey.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.700
I know you're innocent.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:15.620
It must've been some mistake
that you ended up there.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:20.000
Some evil person who didn't
want you to be mayor set you up.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.290
I'm sorry.

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:23.790
Let's fight this together, okay?

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.330
Don't touch me.

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:29.290
...many of you are confused by

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:31.580
the baseless allegations that
have been levied against me.

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:35.080
But I'll do everything I can
to stand up to this abuse of power.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.910
--I can't believe it!
--Yeah.

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:39.330
Listen to the crap he's spewing.

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:42.160
I bet even your sword couldn't
cut through that bullshit.

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:44.950
After what he almost did to me...

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.450
Shameless!

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:49.500
It just shows you that the
legal battle's already begun.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:52.290
It's gonna be hilarious
when you're on the stand.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:55.450
Um... "Leave your socks on,"
was that it?

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:00.750
It's not funny! It's not funny!

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:04.500
All powerful people are like that.
If you get mad at each and every one of them,

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:06.160
you'll waste your whole life.

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:08.700
You should be getting more upset!

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:09.750
Should I?

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:12.040
I don't want to see his face.

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.870
I'll wait for you in the car.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.790
Hey, Tilarna.

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:22.250
It's me, Zoey. Did you forget me?

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:28.450
No, you just seemed different...

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:31.370
This is how I am, usually.
You got arrested too, right?

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:32.660
Did they let you go?

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:34.040
I guess...

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:36.790
I had somebody post bail for me.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:42.500
Well, whatever.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.120
Look what they gave me.

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:45.700
A tracker?

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:48.410
If you wear this, they give you
a discount on your bail.

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:51.790
Anyway, are you free?

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:57.160
I guess...

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:06.750
I didn't think you were going
to ask me to help you move.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:08.700
This is a huge help!

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:11.410
They kicked me out and I didn't know what to do.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:14.160
A lot of the movers around here
can't be trusted...

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:17.330
It's gonna fall! You're gonna hit something!

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.450
I'm sorry I just disappeared.

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:23.700
Something came up.

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:26.330
No! I'm not mad at you!

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:28.000
I'm hanging up.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:36.200
Who was that?

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:39.660
My mom... or something like that.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:42.120
Here, this is your thank-you.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:44.250
Just this?

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:45.580
You want this too?

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:46.910
No.

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:48.500
Anyway, did you find a place to stay?

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:50.160
Yup.

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:51.160
Let's go.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.950
You can see the ocean!

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:08.950
You can give me the review later.
Help me move this stuff!

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:11.660
That can wait! Take a look!

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:13.580
This is your move!

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:15.500
What do you mean it can wait?

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.750
You're so serious, Tilarna.

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:26.950
What is that thing?

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.910
It's a camera. Haven't you heard of it?

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:32.410
I've heard of it.

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:34.790
Did you take these?

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:36.580
Yes. They're my work.

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:40.450
Beautiful...

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.540
Thank you.

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.790
--Even if you're just being nice, I appreciate it.
--No.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.830
I don't understand the technology, but...

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:51.330
The people of this town... I don't know.

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.200
They feel like they're alive.

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:55.250
Inside this square frame...

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.750
You're making me blush!

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.250
Is your real job a photographer?

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.620
No way! It's just a hobby!

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:10.540
I'm hoping I can open
an exhibition someday, though.

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.870
If you do, I'm going to come see it, okay?

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:17.580
Oh, you want one?

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:18.620
Really?

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.000
As a thank-you.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.830
I need to give you something
more than a burrito.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:24.750
But I can't choose...

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:35.750
Not one of these. I'll take one for you.

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:38.160
It'll take some time, but I promise I'll do it!

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:42.660
--Just 100 dollars!
--What?

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.080
I was just kidding!

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.250
Assistant Prosecutor Gardner!

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:51.410
Sergeant Matoba.

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:54.410
Where's Exedilica?

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:57.250
Oh, she's on patrol.

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:58.700
Patrol?

00:09:58.700 --> 00:09:59.830
Want me to call her?

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:02.500
No, this is nothing interesting.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.330
Just brief her later.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:10.080
It's about Mozeleemay.
His lawyer's pitching a fit to the media.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:13.660
The police roughed him up. Set him up.

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:16.120
That always happens. What's the problem?

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:19.000
There isn't one. We just need to tell him
we've got the recording from his arrest,

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:22.540
and he'll shut up.
The conversation your partner recorded,

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:23.910
with the, uh...

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:25.700
--The socks?
--That's right.

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:31.290
Video alone isn't enough proof these days.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:34.830
What about the date club's
customer list and their financials?

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.250
Unfortunately,

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:41.370
they've been really careful with their
use of encoding and cryptocurrencies.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:44.410
We don't have enough to convince a judge yet.

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:48.290
Mozeleemay doesn't know
that yet, though, does he?

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:50.080
Bluff.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.750
That's the plan.

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.540
We push hard and he'll give in.

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:57.700
We may be able to get information
on some of his connections.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:10:58.700
Sounds good.

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:02.540
We're the only ones with
the data from the date club.

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:04.160
You're sure, right?

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:07.500
Yeah, that should be right.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:10.700
Okay, I'll keep that in mind
when I'm going forward.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.790
Perfect timing.

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:30.250
Who was that?

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.870
Zoey. From the date club.

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:34.660
The sex worker, huh?

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:37.910
She's quitting, she says.
So we became friends.

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:41.000
Friends? We're cops.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.450
Don't worry.

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:47.120
She thinks I'm some rich girl
who ran away from home.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:49.330
Fine. Don't meet with her again.

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:50.160
What?

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:54.700
I told you not to see her again.
Mozeleemay's trial's coming up.

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:59.000
That Zoey girl might end up
on the stand, you know?

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:00.870
What's the problem?

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:03.040
She'll think you betrayed her.

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.410
She may get mad and refuse to testify.

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:08.950
That's... I'm a Knight of Mirvor.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:13.370
If I tell her about my desire for justice,
I'm sure she'll understand.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:16.870
Ridiculous. You think she'll be so
impressed she'll drop to her knees?

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:23.080
Listen to me, Tilarna. Don't get involved
with the people you're investigating.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:26.290
--But...
--You can't be friends with them.

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:27.700
You live in different worlds.

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:31.120
Different worlds?
Then what about you and me?

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:33.540
That's... something different.

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:36.160
It's not different! It's not different at all!

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:40.830
I can't accept that.

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:58.580
Isn't it expensive?

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:01.330
The rent here.

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:02.870
It's got a great view.

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:04.040
I guess.

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:05.910
Are you going back to your old job?

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:07.830
What about you?

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:08.830
I...

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.580
You should quit for good.

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:14.450
Your parents are rich,
and you ran away from home, right?

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:16.950
I'm not blaming you.

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:21.000
I know you want to have your adventures.
I like adventuring too, you know.

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:27.500
Not getting enough sleep?

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:28.750
No, I...

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:33.040
You're hanging out with Zoey, right?
You're coming home late every night.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:36.040
--Knock it off...
--Are you my mom?

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:39.000
--Huh?
--It's what you always say.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.040
I don't want lectures.

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:42.410
Listen...

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:45.950
Gardner?

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:47.700
We've got a problem.

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:50.790
The San-Teresa police
responded to the leak by...

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:53.370
What the hell is going on?

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:55.120
No way to know yet.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:58.200
Most of the names on the list
that's going around are fake.

00:13:58.200 --> 00:13:59.870
But some of them aren't.

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:01.290
That's why it's bad.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:04.870
So Mozeleemay becomes one
of the supposedly fake victims?

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:06.410
The preliminary hearing is coming up.

00:14:06.410 --> 00:14:09.370
And the judge isn't going to like this at all.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.330
We may not be able to prosecute at all!

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.500
So he won't face punishment at all?

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:14.870
Relax.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:17.790
All we need to do is find
where the list came from.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.040
But...

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.790
So we keep working, then?

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.540
Yes. Let's find them.

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:33.830
Nobody's following you, right?

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:37.160
No idea. You're the one who
wanted to meet in person, right?

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:46.660
Your information was good.

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:47.950
Then give me the rest of the money.

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:51.450
What?

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.500
I want the rest of the information.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:55.750
That customer list is incomplete.

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:57.290
That's going cost you another 20,000.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:15:00.080
It's right here. Look for yourself.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.830
You're all ready, huh?

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.450
There seems to be more than there should be.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:08.700
You know why.

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:09.620
Why?

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:13.410
You came because you wanted it, right?

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.290
Stop it, Mr. Mozeleemay.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:19.910
If you just wanted to make a deal,
you could've done it online.

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:22.910
Let me guess. You couldn't forget me, could you?

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:27.040
That was business. And I quit.

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:30.080
Then why not get back into it?

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:33.450
I can satisfy you. I was a good customer.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.040
Right? Right?

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.120
Look.

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:42.660
You're far too careless.

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:43.540
Give me that!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:46.370
Go ahead and delete it. This one's on the house.

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:48.950
You bitch... How dare you?

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:50.870
I'm being nice, actually.

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:53.120
Why not be a little more careful?

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:54.790
--Get out!
--Sure.

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:57.120
Oh, I'll send you the data you want.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:58.620
Get out!

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:02.620
Pleasure doing business!

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:10.910
Got it.

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:12.700
Take care of that too, then.

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:16.660
Another dead end.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:19.700
I'm starting to think that
Mozeleemay's side may not

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.500
have access to our info at all.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:22.540
Kei...

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:27.290
Could it be one of the workers at that club?

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.580
One of the sex workers had
a copy of the customer list?

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:34.870
I don't know. If they were that smart,
they'd probably be at another job.

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:37.000
About that. Can I say something?

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.080
What's up?

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:43.250
I was looking at the drives
of the PCs we confiscated.

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.160
Oh, copies of them, specifically.

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:47.040
I know that. So?

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:49.450
I was able to restore the logs off the webcams.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:52.950
It shows photos of everybody who accessed
the customer list before we got it.

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:56.200
Most of the time it's the owner
and her suits, but...

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:59.330
Looks like one of the girls
accessed it several times.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.370
Her.

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:03.870
Zoey!

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:14.910
We won't be able to prosecute at this rate.

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:20.540
We need to convince a judge
as to what's real and what's fake.

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:23.870
At a minimum, we need to convince
them that it's not a leak from the police

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:25.410
or the prosecutor's office.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:28.500
I have an idea. Buy me time.

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:30.620
You okay?

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:32.120
With what?

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:34.040
I can talk to her if you want.

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:37.040
No. I should talk to her, I think.

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:39.290
Okay.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.870
Zoey?

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:46.790
Zoey?

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:05.620
Wow! Don't move a muscle!

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:08.250
What are you doing?

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:10.330
That's my line!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:12.000
What's that krehg for?

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:16.160
Anyway... remember what
I promised you? It's ready.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:17.910
Zoey, we need to talk.

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:22.000
I wasn't sure which to give you.

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.410
In the end, I just gave you
the most obvious choice.

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:24.370
Zoey!

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:26.200
What?

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:28.290
The customer data from the dating club.

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:30.750
You sold it to Mozeleemay, didn't you?

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.040
What are you talking about?

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:34.540
Don't lie to me. I already know the answer.

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:37.540
You a cop?

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:42.370
You are, aren't you?

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:44.580
I didn't mean to lie to you.

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:46.250
You disgust me.

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:48.910
It was a coincidence.

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:49.910
I...

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.000
I'll go after them.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.620
You stay with her!

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:08.290
But...

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:09.870
Just stay with her!

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:18.660
Stop! This is the police!

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:24.080
I thought you were a friend!

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:25.370
So did I!

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:28.040
You said you were quitting!

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:33.000
What would a rich girl like you know?

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:38.000
Do you have any idea how hard it is
to go straight in this town?

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.000
Zoey!

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:49.200
I've got nothing to be ashamed of.

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.830
Zoey, hang in there...

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:54.200
I didn't do anything...

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:56.750
Zoey!

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:03.290
Who hired you?

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:04.290
Tell me!

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:09.500
Shit!

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:26.000
It's me.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:29.160
I see.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:30.950
Got it.

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:34.290
Our informant was shot. She's badly injured.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:35.330
I see...

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:38.660
If she dies, I may be able to get away with it.

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:40.160
They won't be able--

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:43.120
Don't tell me... It was you?

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:45.830
What are you talking about?

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:52.950
Don't think about a thing.

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:54.790
That's for the best.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.500
That look on your face scares me.

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:05.500
You look like you're about to go beat
the shit out of Mozeleemay right now.

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:07.870
He sent an assassin after her.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:09.370
Got evidence?

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:12.250
No. But it has to be him.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:16.580
If that was good enough, we never would have--

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:18.500
Is that your people's "justice"?

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:22.120
I can't just let him get away with this!

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:25.040
Zoey... Zoey...

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:29.870
She was my friend!

00:23:42.750 --> 00:23:44.410
"Next Time"
Next time on <i>COP CRAFT</i>:
